# Wallet Service - Pruebas manuales de la API
# Prueba técnica - Periferia IT Group
# Ejecutar go run ./cmd/api antes de iniciar.
# Usar un servidor recién iniciado y ejecutar las solicitudes en orden.
# Los datos se almacenan en memoria y los montos están en centavos.
# Ejecutar cada POST una sola vez, excepto la prueba de idempotencia.

@baseUrl = http://localhost:8080

### 01. Crear cuenta de Ana - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "owner": "Ana",
    "initial_balance": 10000
}

### 02. Crear cuenta de Juan - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "owner": "Juan",
    "initial_balance": 5000
}

### 03. Consultar cuenta de Ana - 200 OK, saldo 10000
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_1

### 04. Consultar cuenta de Juan - 200 OK, saldo 5000
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_2

### 05. Transferir de Ana a Juan - 201 Created, trf_1
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "acc_1",
    "to_account_id": "acc_2",
    "amount": 2500
}

### 06. Consultar saldo de Ana - 200 OK, saldo 7500
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_1

### 07. Consultar saldo de Juan - 200 OK, saldo 7500
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_2

### 08. Consultar historial de Ana - 200 OK, trf_1
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_1/transfers

### 09. Consultar historial de Juan - 200 OK, trf_1
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_2/transfers

### 10. Crear cuenta de Carlos sin saldo - 201 Created
POST {{baseUrl}}/accounts
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "owner": "Carlos",
    "initial_balance": 0
}

### 11. Consultar historial vacío de Carlos - 200 OK, []
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_3/transfers

### 12. Validar fondos insuficientes - 422 Unprocessable Entity
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "acc_1",
    "to_account_id": "acc_2",
    "amount": 10000
}

### 13. Comprobar saldo de Ana tras el rechazo - 200 OK, saldo 7500
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_1

### 14. Comprobar saldo de Juan tras el rechazo - 200 OK, saldo 7500
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_2

### 15. Validar monto cero - 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "acc_1",
    "to_account_id": "acc_2",
    "amount": 0
}

### 16. Validar transferencia a la misma cuenta - 400 Bad Request
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "from_account_id": "acc_1",
    "to_account_id": "acc_1",
    "amount": 1000
}

### 17. Consultar cuenta inexistente - 404 Not Found
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_999

### 18. Crear transferencia con clave de idempotencia - 201 Created, trf_2
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: prueba-manual-001

{
    "from_account_id": "acc_1",
    "to_account_id": "acc_2",
    "amount": 1000
}

### 19. Repetir la transferencia - 201 Created, mismo ID y fecha de creación
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: prueba-manual-001

{
    "from_account_id": "acc_1",
    "to_account_id": "acc_2",
    "amount": 1000
}

### 20. Reutilizar la clave con otro monto - 409 Conflict
POST {{baseUrl}}/transfers
Content-Type: application/json
Idempotency-Key: prueba-manual-001

{
    "from_account_id": "acc_1",
    "to_account_id": "acc_2",
    "amount": 2000
}

### 21. Consultar saldo final de Ana - 200 OK, saldo 6500
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_1

### 22. Consultar saldo final de Juan - 200 OK, saldo 8500
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_2

### 23. Consultar historial final de Ana - 200 OK, trf_1 y trf_2
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_1/transfers

### 24. Consultar historial final de Juan - 200 OK, trf_1 y trf_2
GET {{baseUrl}}/accounts/acc_2/transfers
